<title>POLAND: Poligrafia Q1 net rises to PLN 0.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Poligrafia Q1 net rises to PLN 0.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poligrafia preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.21 vs	1.14</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.31 vs	0.87</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.75 vs	0.51</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Poligrafia SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  8.97 vs	8.45</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   7.76 vs	7.32</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.56 vs	0.35</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.10 vs	0.02</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.00 vs	0.29</p>
<p>    investment				 0.27 vs	0.54</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
